        "role": "user",
        "content": "{\"original_question\":\"Can you suggest some new cooking techniques or recipes I might enjoy exploring?\",\"task\":{\"question\":\"What cooking techniques and recipes has the user tried and enjoyed or disliked in the past?\",\"output_slot\":\"past_experiences\",\"answer_type\":\"text\",\"inputs\":[],\"execution\":\"retrieval\"},\"grounded_subquestion\":\"What cooking techniques and recipes has the user tried and enjoyed or disliked in the past?\",\"request_context\":{\"query_identity\":\"e0fea9c849fc11e222a3255b8ddc0ec1d8bb61b1b5ed588b7e52a3316f512103\",\"algorithm_version\":\"dagbt_residual_memory_v2\",\"program_identity\":\"53b15da824741bb45529289312fbd2336292171aa33d3c580c969649d4cd7d1c\",\"initial_dag_identity\":\"0321f360890f32a1dfaf3f0de6a8f39fa6a6b04030e6e175d7b302b666207ca8\"},\"variables\":{\"past_experiences\":{\"type\":\"text\",\"demand\":\"past_experiences\",\"scope\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\"},\"evidence_semantics\":\"personal_history_summary\"}},\"requested_slots\":[\"past_experiences\"],\"requested_scopes\":{\"past_experiences\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\"}},\"output_contract\":{\"mode\":\"semantic\",\"result_type\":\"text\",\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"current\",\"explanation\":\"semantic\"},\"program_revision\":0,\"rule_binding\":null,\"supported_parents\":{},\"known_observations\":[],\"source_spans\":[[\"s1\",\"d1\",0,99,\"Conversation message indices 93–94 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s2\",\"d1\",99,105,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s3\",\"d1\",105,432,\"User: I've been exploring my passion for food lately, especially cooking. Cooking has become a delightful escape for me, a means of expressing my creativity and bringing joy to others. The process of selecting fresh ingredients, experimenting with different flavors, and presenting a dish beautifully is incredibly fulfilling. \",\"user\",[93]],[\"s4\",\"d1\",432,769,\"I often find myself lost in the nuances of taste and texture, and it's rewarding to see how a simple meal can evoke such happiness in those who share it with me. Lately, I've been trying to perfect my skills in making different cuisines, from Italian to Thai, and it has opened up a whole new world of culinary traditions and techniques.\",\"user\",[93]],[\"s5\",\"d1\",769,782,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s6\",\"d1\",782,1087,\"Assistant: That's wonderful to hear! Cooking is indeed a powerful way to express oneself, as it combines art and science in such a remarkable way. The joy of transforming raw ingredients into a delicious meal not only satisfies hunger but can create unforgettable memories for you and those you cook for. \",\"assistant\",[94]],[\"s7\",\"d1\",1087,1447,\"It's fascinating how different cultures approach cooking, using unique ingredients and techniques passed down through generations, enriching our understanding of the world through food. Cooking can also serve as a gateway to mindfulness, allowing you to engage your senses fully in the act of preparing a meal, and creating a meditative space in your kitchen. \",\"assistant\",[94]],[\"s8\",\"d1\",1447,1754,\"Furthermore, the challenge of mastering new dishes enhances your culinary skills and builds confidence each time you step into the kitchen. I'm curious, what specific cuisines or dishes have you been exploring most recently, and have you discovered any favorite flavors or techniques that resonate with you?\",\"assistant\",[94]],[\"s9\",\"d2\",0,99,\"Conversation message indices 95–96 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s10\",\"d2\",99,105,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s11\",\"d2\",105,392,\"User: I even took a cooking class recently to learn new techniques and recipes, which was really enlightening! It was fascinating to explore not just the recipes but also the cultural background behind them, as many dishes come with rich histories that deepen our appreciation for food. \",\"user\",[95]],[\"s12\",\"d2\",392,791,\"The hands-on experience of preparing different cuisines has really expanded my palate and made me consider how flavors interact in cooking. I also got to meet some amazing fellow food enthusiasts who shared their own stories and tips during the class, creating a vibrant community focused on culinary arts. Overall, it was much more than a class; it felt like a journey into the heart of gastronomy.\",\"user\",[95]],[\"s13\",\"d2\",791,804,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s14\",\"d2\",804,1130,\"Assistant: That's great to hear! Cooking classes can really open up your culinary skills and provide a wonderful opportunity to connect with others who share your passion for food. They often introduce not only various cooking techniques but also essential tips for utilizing ingredients you might not have considered before. \",\"assistant\",[96]],[\"s15\",\"d2\",1130,1465,\"Engaging in such classes can transform your view of cooking from a chore into an enjoyable and fulfilling activity, much like a form of art where you can express creativity. Additionally, many participants find that cooking together leads to meaningful conversations, where people bond over their shared love for culinary exploration. \",\"assistant\",[96]],[\"s16\",\"d2\",1465,1744,\"Trying out new recipes and techniques can even spark inspiration for meal planning, making weeknight dinners less repetitive and more exciting. Overall, it’s heartwarming to see how cooking brings people together and fosters connections through creativity and shared experiences.\",\"assistant\",[96]],[\"s17\",\"d3\",0,101,\"Conversation message indices 111–112 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s18\",\"d3\",101,107,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s19\",\"d3\",107,464,\"User: I really enjoy experimenting with different cuisines, and I recently made a traditional dish from another culture, which was quite an intriguing experience. The colorful ingredients and the rich history behind each recipe often inspire me to learn more about the culture itself, broadening my culinary horizons and appreciation for global traditions. \",\"user\",[111]],[\"s20\",\"d3\",464,817,\"It's fascinating to think about how food serves as a bridge between people, fostering connections and understanding through shared meals and flavors. I often find that every dish tells a story of its origins, the journeys of the ingredients, and the techniques passed down through generations, making cooking a deeply personal and cultural exploration. \",\"user\",[111]],[\"s21\",\"d3\",817,997,\"This experience was particularly enlightening because I learned not only about the ingredients but also about the customs and rituals that accompany the dish in its native context.\",\"user\",[111]],[\"s22\",\"d3\",997,1010,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s23\",\"d3\",1010,1394,\"Assistant: That sounds exciting! Exploring international cuisines can lead to some amazing discoveries, enriching our lives in ways that go beyond mere nourishment. The act of preparing a traditional dish not only showcases the unique flavors and cooking methods of a different culture, but it also opens a window to understanding the very essence of those people and their heritage. \",\"assistant\",[112]],[\"s24\",\"d3\",1394,1599,\"Each cuisine carries its own peculiar customs, stories, and even seasonal significance, often intertwined with festivals, celebrations, or familial gatherings, which enhances the experience of cooking it. \",\"assistant\",[112]],[\"s25\",\"d3\",1599,1971,\"Moreover, in many cultures, the preparation of food is a communal activity that brings friends and family together, allowing for the sharing of not just ingredients but also emotions, laughter, and love. It’s interesting how culinary practices can evolve over time, adapting to the availability of local ingredients while still preserving the spirit of the original dish. \",\"assistant\",[112]],[\"s26\",\"d3\",1971,2326,\"Embracing these food adventures can foster a deeper sense of connection to the world and encourage a more inclusive perspective on diverse cultural practices. I'm curious to hear which dish you made, as it might reveal even more about the culture that inspired it and, perhaps, encourage a few more tantalizing ideas for your future culinary explorations.\",\"assistant\",[112]],[\"s36\",\"d4\",0,99,\"Conversation message indices 69–70 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s37\",\"d4\",99,105,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s38\",\"d4\",105,458,\"User: I joined a couples cooking workshop to explore new cuisines and meet new people. It was really enjoyable! The atmosphere in the kitchen was vibrant, filled with the aroma of spices and fresh ingredients. We were all eagerly trying to follow the chef's instructions, which made for some entertaining moments when things didn’t quite go as planned. \",\"user\",[69]],[\"s39\",\"d4\",458,745,\"I particularly loved the way everyone seemed to open up and share stories about their culinary experiences, which truly made it feel like a communal gathering rather than a formal class. Overall, it was a delightful way to blend learning with social interaction and culinary exploration.\",\"user\",[69]],[\"s40\",\"d4\",745,758,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s41\",\"d4\",758,1148,\"Assistant: Cooking together can be a fantastic way to connect. It has this unique ability to break down barriers and foster a sense of camaraderie among participants, especially when everyone is actively involved in the preparation of a meal. The shared laughter and occasional mishaps in the kitchen often lead to lasting friendships, as those moments create a bond that's hard to forget. \",\"assistant\",[70]],[\"s42\",\"d4\",1148,1491,\"Did you make any new friends there? It's fascinating how food can serve as a conversation starter, opening avenues for discussions that might otherwise feel too personal or awkward. The sense of accomplishment when you create something delicious together is another layer that adds to the experience, leaving everyone with cherished memories. \",\"assistant\",[70]],[\"s43\",\"d4\",1491,1600,\"I would love to hear more about the dishes you all prepared; they might inspire me to try new recipes myself.\",\"assistant\",[70]],[\"s44\",\"d5\",0,101,\"Conversation message indices 115–116 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s45\",\"d5\",101,107,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s46\",\"d5\",107,503,\"User: I also watched a cooking show, but I found it unengaging; I much prefer hands-on experiences. The imagery and techniques presented may have been appealing, but they lacked the personal touch that comes with actually cooking for myself. There’s something incredibly rewarding about selecting fresh ingredients, measuring them precisely, and then seeing them transform into a delicious dish. \",\"user\",[115]],[\"s47\",\"d5\",503,838,\"Watching someone else cook, no matter how talented they are, can't replicate the joy of feeling the textures of this food in my hands and tasting the flavors as they meld together. Moreover, in a hands-on experience, I can experiment and adjust flavors to suit my personal preferences, something that a static show simply cannot offer.\",\"user\",[115]],[\"s48\",\"d5\",838,851,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s49\",\"d5\",851,1092,\"Assistant: That makes sense. Nothing beats the joy of cooking yourself! When you are actively engaged in the cooking process, each step becomes an opportunity for learning and creativity, allowing you to truly express yourself through food. \",\"assistant\",[116]],[\"s50\",\"d5\",1092,1442,\"The aromas that fill the kitchen as you sauté vegetables or bake bread create an atmosphere of anticipation and satisfaction that watching a screen simply cannot capture. Plus, there’s that delightful moment when you taste your creation for the first time; the excitement of discovering whether the flavors harmonize as you intended is unparalleled. \",\"assistant\",[116]],[\"s51\",\"d5\",1442,1764,\"Engaging in hands-on cooking also allows for the serendipity of experimentation, where you might stumble upon an unexpected flavor combination that delights and surprises you. Each dish becomes a personal journey, a reflection of your tastes, preferences, and even the memories associated with the ingredients you choose. \",\"assistant\",[116]],[\"s52\",\"d5\",1764,2083,\"In addition, cooking can serve as a stress-relieving activity, a way to unplug from the chaos of daily life and focus on something tactile and rewarding. It's not just about the food; it's about the experience itself, the connection to the ingredients, and the joy of creating something that can be shared with others. \",\"assistant\",[116]],[\"s53\",\"d5\",2083,2206,\"Overall, there's a profound sense of accomplishment that comes with cooking that can't be matched by passive viewing alone.\",\"assistant\",[116]],[\"s62\",\"d6\",0,99,\"Conversation message indices 54–55 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s63\",\"d6\",99,105,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s64\",\"d6\",105,493,\"User: Absolutely! It felt like a more relaxed environment to get to know someone while focusing on something fun. The atmosphere was vibrant and inviting, filled with the tantalizing aromas of diverse ingredients coming together. We laughed and shared stories while chopping vegetables and stirring pots, making the experience not just about cooking but about connection and camaraderie. \",\"user\",[54]],[\"s65\",\"d6\",493,737,\"It was fascinating to see how cooking has the ability to break down barriers and create a sense of community among strangers. Each dish we created became a topic of discussion, allowing us to bond over our culinary successes and failures alike.\",\"user\",[54]],[\"s66\",\"d6\",737,750,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s67\",\"d6\",750,1035,\"Assistant: Cooking classes can be great for fostering connections, and it's wonderful to hear that you had such a delightful experience! They often provide a unique opportunity to engage with others in a creative and interactive setting, much different from typical social gatherings. \",\"assistant\",[55]],[\"s68\",\"d6\",1035,1223,\"By focusing on the task of preparing a meal, participants can naturally shift their attention away from the pressure of forming a connection, which can make interactions flow more freely. \",\"assistant\",[55]],[\"s69\",\"d6\",1223,1450,\"Additionally, the collaborative nature of working together on recipes often leads to shared achievements, sparking conversations about personal tastes, cooking backgrounds, and even cherished family traditions related to food. \",\"assistant\",[55]],[\"s70\",\"d6\",1450,1641,\"Such an environment not only enhances culinary skills but also builds friendships that can extend beyond the kitchen, helping to create lasting memories and connections that enrich our lives.\",\"assistant\",[55]],[\"s71\",\"d7\",0,101,\"Conversation message indices 103–104 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s72\",\"d7\",101,107,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s73\",\"d7\",107,479,\"User: I attended the annual food festival in the city, tasting various international cuisines. It was delicious! The atmosphere was buzzing with excitement, as numerous vendors set up their stalls, each offering a unique dish from their home country. The tantalizing aromas wafted through the air, mingling spicy, sweet, and savory scents that beckoned all who passed by. \",\"user\",[103]],[\"s74\",\"d7\",479,770,\"I found myself devouring everything from tantalizing tacos to fragrant pho, each bite bursting with flavors that transported me to distant lands. It really was an unforgettable experience, one that made me appreciate the diversity of cultures and culinary traditions that exist in our world.\",\"user\",[103]],[\"s75\",\"d7\",770,783,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s76\",\"d7\",783,1083,\"Assistant: Those festivals are a goldmine for trying new things, and it's wonderful that you had such an enjoyable experience. Food festivals often serve as a melting pot of flavors, where you can embark on a culinary journey without ever leaving your city, evoking the spirit of a global adventure. \",\"assistant\",[104]],[\"s77\",\"d7\",1083,1374,\"I'm really curious to know which particular cuisine stood out to you the most among all the mouthwatering options available that day. Was there a specific dish that left a lasting impression, perhaps due to its unique ingredients or preparation methods that you've never encountered before? \",\"assistant\",[104]],[\"s78\",\"d7\",1374,1625,\"Furthermore, tasting dishes from various cultures often reveals the stories and histories behind them, providing a richer understanding and connection to each cuisine—it's fascinating how a simple meal can reflect the essence of a culture's identity. \",\"assistant\",[104]],[\"s79\",\"d7\",1625,1934,\"Additionally, such events are not only delightful for the palate but also foster a sense of community, as people gather to share in the joy of food, celebrating diversity and togetherness through each dish served. So, what was your absolute favorite cuisine from the festival? I'm eager to hear more about it!\",\"assistant\",[104]],[\"s80\",\"d8\",0,99,\"Conversation message indices 17–18 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s81\",\"d8\",99,105,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s82\",\"d8\",105,392,\"User: I also organized a cooking date for a friend recently, and it was truly wonderful to see them connect over the process of creating something delicious together. There's just something magical about the way preparing food can break down barriers and foster intimacy between people. \",\"user\",[17]],[\"s83\",\"d8\",392,771,\"As they chopped vegetables and stirred sauces, you could feel the energy in the room shift, turning what might normally be a routine task into a delightful exercise in teamwork. I enjoyed watching them share laughter as they navigated the kitchen, discovering who was better at whisking or flipping pancakes, which added an element of playful competition to their time together. \",\"user\",[17]],[\"s84\",\"d8\",771,948,\"Their enthusiasm for trying new recipes turned a simple evening into a memorable culinary adventure, filled with joy and camaraderie that I hope helped to strengthen their bond.\",\"user\",[17]],[\"s85\",\"d8\",948,961,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s86\",\"d8\",961,1165,\"Assistant: Cooking dates can indeed be a great bonding experience for couples, as they provide an opportunity not just for collaboration but also for communication and connection in a delightful setting. \",\"assistant\",[18]],[\"s87\",\"d8\",1165,1495,\"When partners engage in preparing a meal together, they are not only sharing an activity but also the rich tapestry of their cultures, tastes, and preferences, which can lead to deeper understanding. The sights and smells of sizzling ingredients or the sounds of laughter truly create a warm atmosphere that can be so fulfilling. \",\"assistant\",[18]],[\"s88\",\"d8\",1495,1695,\"Furthermore, sharing the culinary process often involves learning about each other's strengths, weaknesses, and personal styles, laying the foundation for teamwork that can extend beyond the kitchen. \",\"assistant\",[18]],[\"s89\",\"d8\",1695,1932,\"It's fascinating how food acts as a universal language, bridging differences and bringing people closer, making such moments memorable not only for the delicious results but also for the shared experiences that enrich their relationship.\",\"assistant\",[18]],[\"s90\",\"d9\",0,101,\"Conversation message indices 153–154 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s91\",\"d9\",101,107,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s92\",\"d9\",107,450,\"User: I also opted out of cooking classes that I once enjoyed. Initially, these classes were a delightful escape for me, allowing me to explore new recipes and techniques in a supportive environment. However, over time, the atmosphere transformed significantly; it became more about competition and performance rather than the joy of cooking. \",\"user\",[153]],[\"s93\",\"d9\",450,734,\"The pressure to excel and impress the instructor took away from the simple pleasure of being in the kitchen, experimenting with flavors and ingredients. It became clear that the experience was no longer fulfilling, and I decided it was best to step back from those classes altogether.\",\"user\",[153]],[\"s94\",\"d9\",734,747,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s95\",\"d9\",747,1111,\"Assistant: That’s understandable, and I'm glad you're recognizing what environment works best for you. When we engage in activities that are meant to be enjoyable, the last thing we want is for them to become sources of stress or anxiety. It's particularly important to prioritize comfort and relaxation, especially in contexts as intimate and personal as dating. \",\"assistant\",[154]],[\"s96\",\"d9\",1111,1426,\"The shift in focus to café meetings is a wonderful choice, as these settings often allow for more organic conversations and genuine connections. The casual vibe of a café usually fosters a sense of ease, where the pressures of formal setups are stripped away, allowing individuals the space to truly be themselves. \",\"assistant\",[154]],[\"s97\",\"d9\",1426,1746,\"Plus, there's something inherently comforting about sipping a warm beverage while engaging in meaningful dialogue amidst the soft sounds of a lively café. Perhaps you have a favorite spot in mind that embodies this relaxed atmosphere. How do you feel about the dynamics of café meetings compared to previous experiences?\",\"assistant\",[154]],[\"s107\",\"d10\",0,101,\"Conversation message indices 113–114 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s108\",\"d10\",101,107,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s109\",\"d10\",107,397,\"User: I tried baking cookies for the first time, but I discovered it wasn't as rewarding as I thought it would be. The anticipation of the sweet aroma wafting through the kitchen was something I looked forward to, but when it came down to the actual process, it felt more tedious than fun. \",\"user\",[113]],[\"s110\",\"d10\",397,674,\"I envisioned myself joyfully mixing the dough, but instead, it seemed like an endless chore with each step dragging on longer than anticipated. The measurements were tricky, and I felt anxious about whether I was doing everything correctly, which took away from the enjoyment. \",\"user\",[113]],[\"s111\",\"d10\",674,839,\"Overall, it was supposed to be a delightful adventure in the kitchen, but it left me feeling a bit deflated and questioning if I would ever want to try baking again.\",\"user\",[113]],[\"s112\",\"d10\",839,852,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s113\",\"d10\",852,1229,\"Assistant: Baking can definitely be hit or miss! You know, the experience of baking is often romanticized; there’s a certain charm in seeing your creations turn golden brown in the oven, but it can be frustrating when things don’t go as planned. What didn’t you like about the experience? Was it the overwhelming number of steps involved, or perhaps the cleanup that followed? \",\"assistant\",[114]],[\"s114\",\"d10\",1229,1598,\"It’s important to remember that something as seemingly simple as baking cookies can actually be quite complex, involving precise measurements, timing, and even technique. Additionally, the emotional investment we place in the outcome can influence how we feel about the process itself, and if the cookies didn’t turn out as expected, it’s natural to feel disappointed. \",\"assistant\",[114]],[\"s115\",\"d10\",1598,1903,\"I would also love to hear more about what kind of cookies you attempted to bake; certain recipes can be trickier than others and may require a bit more experience to master. And remember, even seasoned bakers have their off days, so don't let one experience discourage you from trying again in the future!\",\"assistant\",[114]],[\"s116\",\"d11\",0,101,\"Conversation message indices 117–118 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s117\",\"d11\",101,107,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s118\",\"d11\",107,402,\"User: I entered a cooking competition, but I felt really stressed under pressure and didn't enjoy it. The atmosphere was electrifying, filled with the scent of spices and the sound of sizzling pans, which initially excited me, but once the competition started, a wave of anxiety washed over me. \",\"user\",[117]],[\"s119\",\"d11\",402,714,\"I found myself constantly glancing at the clock, my heart racing as I tried to keep up with the time constraints while also worrying if my dish would turn out as planned. The pressure of the judges watching my every move only intensified my stress, as I felt the weight of their expectations bearing down on me. \",\"user\",[117]],[\"s120\",\"d11\",714,835,\"Instead of feeling the joy of cooking, I became overwhelmed, losing sight of why I love culinary arts in the first place.\",\"user\",[117]],[\"s121\",\"d11\",835,848,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s122\",\"d11\",848,1065,\"Assistant: Competitions can be intense! It’s understandable if that’s not your thing. Many people enter contests with the hope of showcasing their skills, but the reality can be quite different from our expectations. \",\"assistant\",[118]],[\"s123\",\"d11\",1065,1451,\"The environment can create a whirlwind of emotions, from excitement and determination to anxiety and fear of failure, which can lead to a loss of enjoyment in the very activity that brings us joy. It's not unusual for the thrill of the chase—being in a creative and culinary space with fellow chefs and a panel of judges—to morph into an overwhelming pressure cooker of stress instead. \",\"assistant\",[118]],[\"s124\",\"d11\",1451,1708,\"Sometimes, the competitive spirit can overshadow the pure joy of creating and sharing food, leading one to wonder if it’s worth the stress rather than simply cherishing the act of cooking for the pleasure it brings, both to ourselves and to those we serve. \",\"assistant\",[118]],[\"s125\",\"d11\",1708,1919,\"So, it’s perfectly valid to feel this way, which may lead you to consider how you approach cooking in the future; focusing more on enjoyment rather than competition might be a way to reconnect with that passion.\",\"assistant\",[118]],[\"s126\",\"d12\",0,99,\"Conversation message indices 97–98 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s127\",\"d12\",99,105,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s128\",\"d12\",105,404,\"User: I also went to a highly-rated restaurant with some friends, and we tried their signature dishes. It was such a delightful experience! The atmosphere in the restaurant was buzzing with excitement, filled with laughter and the sounds of clinking glasses as people gathered to enjoy their meals. \",\"user\",[97]]],\"required_scope\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\"},\"rules_completion_required\":false,\"supported_task_outputs\":{},\"personal_response_selection\":true,\"phase\":\"history_evidence\",\"failed_batch_reviews\":[{\"id\":\"failed_batch_bc62eec87efab43387f40bd7\",\"variable\":\"past_experiences\",\"query_identity\":\"e0fea9c849fc11e222a3255b8ddc0ec1d8bb61b1b5ed588b7e52a3316f512103\",\"batch_identity\":\"1a410a6acd7364ffa056e91352953f1bb68a437e50f928af6f6c2ba8763753f7\",\"task_id\":\"past_experiences